Description: transparent TCP, UDP and TLS inspection proxy
 Smithproxy is a multi-process transparent proxy for TCP, UDP, TLS and
 related protocols. It provides traffic inspection, policy enforcement,
 a command-line interface, SOCKS support and certificate-management tools.
